<title>UK: Greenalls to sell fruit machine arm - paper.</title>
<headline>Greenalls to sell fruit machine arm - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>British pub to hotels group Greenalls Plc has put its fruit machine distribution businesses  up for sale as part of a 150 million stg disposal programme, the Sunday Telegraph said.</p>
<p>The group has decided to sell a series of fringe operations to reduce the debt it took on with the acquisition of Boddington last year.</p>
<p>The company was immediately unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
